{"4132760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UrbanYouthSimulator", "steam_appid": 4132760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** </strong>The bug that affected the game progression on the third day after release has been fixed. We will continue optimizing the game, developing more features, and actively hunting for bugs. Steam Workshop , and additional features will be launched in the near future. Thank you once again to all the players who support us!<strong>  *** </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >qq group：1080447265</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Urban Youth Simulator</strong> is an open-world simulation and management game featuring two distinct districts: the Science and Education District, modeled after a real-life university town, and the Commercial District, inspired by bustling downtown bar street scenes. Together, they vividly capture the scholarly youthfulness and vibrant energy of a modern metropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as a recent college graduate who has used all your savings to open a small noodle shop right next to campus. Starting from this modest restaurant, you'll cook dishes with your own hands, serve customers personally, and gradually turn your dreams into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The academic charm of the Science and Education District and the prosperity of the Commercial District await you. As you progress, you'll expand your restaurant, hire staff, grow your business empire, acquire luxury cars and mansions, and even find love... Everything begins in this small noodle shop.<br><br><strong>Authentic Urban Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is based on a real city, featuring handcrafted 3D models of the Science and Education District and Commercial District. It includes dynamic weather systems and a day-night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/e190fdbb519b79793423a08999ed9772.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/e190fdbb519b79793423a08999ed9772.webp?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=737 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/7ff078b428f596df7222941b52e2045c.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/7ff078b428f596df7222941b52e2045c.webp?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/a8adca452f4885a6f159bf971d23524c.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/a8adca452f4885a6f159bf971d23524c.avif?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Hands-On Owner to Business Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a humble street-side restaurant in the Science and Education District and gradually scale up. After accumulating initial capital, you can purchase bar businesses to increase your income, keep an eye on the news, and invest in financial markets to multiply your wealth exponentially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/b29e519c7a9cd25f21274e01b7114783.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/b29e519c7a9cd25f21274e01b7114783.webp?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=737 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/1a058f109f39c48e03e723b9f4d9c0a1.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/1a058f109f39c48e03e723b9f4d9c0a1.webp?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=739 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/28b01a543d248fba2fa5b6629add8d0f.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/28b01a543d248fba2fa5b6629add8d0f.webp?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=740 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Renting and Homeownership System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin in a modest apartment building in the Science and Education District and work your way up to a luxury high-rise residence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/24fbf0ac10718056e28d2ce00ae07c5d.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/57c7c89e93b6490d568a08989d5ab539.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Girlfriend System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a romantic partner, live together, and cultivate a loving relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/6433b6c24c7f23d197785062691deb14.avif?t=1787571540\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras_big/6433b6c24c7f23d197785062691deb14.webp?t=1787571540 width=1560 height=733 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leisure and Entertainment System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you start earning, you can explore both districts—go shopping for clothes, savor gourmet meals, and pick out your dream car. You can also visit the commercial shooting range for some recreation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/2c1e00e34f283e4dde8ce813081fec7d.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/357ca964340184dd8999ba16b7e119be.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/fbb266a4283b095281445864106bee3c.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/d6cb8cec50284bf2971711519e128b17.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132760/extras/8b0f82b847af2111d0b02b43bf17d2f0.avif?t=1787571540\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*** </strong>The bug that affected the game progression on the third day after release has been fixed. We will continue optimizing the game, developing more features, and actively hunting for bugs. Steam Workshop , and additional features will be launched in the near future. Thank you once again to all the players who support us!<strong>  *** </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >qq group：1080447265</p><p class=\"bb_p